<div class="page">
    {% set crumbs = [{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "About", url: "/about/" }] %}
    {% set heroTitle = "About Pioneer PGD" %}
    {% set heroText = "Pioneer PGD is an Upper Hutt company holding certifying plumber, gasfitter and drainlayer licences, one local team across all three trades." %}
    {% set heroImage = "/img/services-gasfitting.jpg" %}
    {% set heroAlt = "About Pioneer PGD, certifying plumber, gasfitter and drainlayer" %}
    {% include "partials/hero.njk" %}

    <section class="section">
        <div class="section--container stack-large">
            <h2>The Local Story</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
            <p>
                Pioneer PGD is owned and operated from Upper Hutt. We live where we
                work, Pinehaven, Trentham, Silverstream and the surrounding
                suburbs, and we're here week in, week out. Being genuinely local
                means faster response, honest advice, and no city-job
                prioritisation for Hutt Valley customers.
            </p>
            <p>
                The name says it: Plumbing, Gasfitting and Drainlaying. Most homes
                need all three at some point, and it's far easier to deal with one
                certified company that covers everything than to juggle three
                separate tradesmen who don't talk to each other.
            </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="section--container stack">
            <h2>Certifying Licences</h2>
            <p>
                Pioneer PGD holds <strong>certifying plumber, certifying gasfitter
                and certifying drainlayer</strong> licences, the highest level
                issued by the Plumbers, Gasfitters and Drainlayers Board (PGDB).
                That means every job is built to the New Zealand Building Code and
                signed off by us, and new installations come with certificates of
                compliance.
            </p>
            <p>
                We're also fully registered with the Board, you can verify our
                licences at any time. It's the difference between a tradesman and
                a certified professional, and it's non-negotiable for us.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="section--container stack">
            <h2>How We Work</h2>
            <div class="local-notes stack">
                <p><strong>Fixed quotes.</strong> You know the price before work starts, no estimates, no surprises.</p>
                <p><strong>Site visits.</strong> For drainage and soak pit work we visit and check soil and access first; for hot water we can usually quote from a couple of questions and photos.</p>
                <p><strong>Consent handled for you.</strong> New drainage and plumbing often needs council consent, we prepare it, arrange inspections and manage sign-off.</p>
                <p><strong>Certified sign-off.</strong> Every job is built to code and certified, with certificates of compliance for new installations.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-mbl">
        <div class="section--container | stack-large">
            <span class="section-label">Where We Excel</span>
            <div class="section--header | stack">
                <h2>Our Specialties</h2>
                <p class="section-intro">The jobs we get called for most, and the ones we know inside out.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="section--wrapper">
                <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
                    {% for s in services %}
                    {% if s.specialty %}
                    <a href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/" class="home-card home-card--specialty">
                        <div class="home-card--img">
                            <img src="{{ s.specialty.image }}" alt="{{ s.specialty.imageAlt }}" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-card--body">
                            <div class="home-card--header">
                                <img class="home-card--icon" src="{{ s.icon }}" alt="{{ s.iconAlt }}" />
                                <h3>{{ s.specialty.heading | safe }}</h3>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="section--container">
            {% include "partials/who-we-are.njk" %}
        </div>
    </section>
</div>